        "gg7lHm-Q9I-_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Curious about how Shilajit makes its way from the mountains to your supplement bottle? Dive into the world of sustainable sourcing and meticulous quality control in Shilajit production...</span></p>",
